{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27341","headline":"贺收复秦原诸州诗 · 白敏中","name":"贺收复秦原诸州诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"一诏皇城四海颁，丑戎无数束身还。\n戍楼吹笛人休战，牧野嘶风马自闲。\n河水九盘收数曲，天山千里锁诸关。\n西边北塞今无事，爲报东南夷与蛮。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白敏中","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_27341.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_27341","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}